Here are the domain objects:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Traveler",
      "description": "Person who searches destinations and creates trip plans",
      "attributes": [
        "Preference"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Preference",
      "description": "Traveler’s interests that guide suggestions"
    },
    {
      "name": "Travel Destination",
