      "attributes": [
        "User Account"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "User Account",
      "description": "Account profile for platform users"
    },
    {
      "name": "Review",
      "description": "Feedback and rating for a visited place",
      "attributes": [
        "Rating"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Location",
      "description": "Specific place tied to an Attraction or Accommodation",
      "attributes": [
        "Attraction",
        "Accommodation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Platform Administrator",
      "description": "Person who manages accounts and platform compliance"
    },
    {
      "name": "Usage Data",
      "description": "Information about how users interact with the platform"
    },
    {
      "name": "Booking Manager",
      "description": "Person who manages reservations and availability"
    },
    {
      "name": "Reservation Option",
      "description": "Bookable option for a destination",
      "attributes": [
        "Accommodation",
        "Travel"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Recommendation Engine",
      "description": "System that evaluates preferences to suggest trips"
    },
    {
      "name": "Itinerary Recommendation",
      "description": "Suggested trip plan generated for a Traveler"
    }
  ]
}
```

Help me find the associations.  

#### Task:
- Draw connections between objects that have an association. 
- Name each object and add a description that captures the meaning of the association.
- Return the associations in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "...",
      "to": "...",
      "description": "..."
    }
  ]
}
```

